window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A hunter reborn. Four Immortal Alphas. What could go wrong? </p> <p>\"You're a Hunter, Remy.\" </p> <p>Those four words changed my life. One minute, I'm human, engaged, and ready to start my life. Then my 21st birthday rocks round, bringing with it the biggest god damn shock of my life. </p> <p>I'm a Hunter. Nephillim. Monsters are real. And this isn't my first life. </p> <p>With more secrets than I could have ever believed, and a world so far from what I thought I knew. My enemies are not who they seem, and this world isn't just black and white.</p> <p><i>Contains mature themes.</i></p>"; 
